    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../bootstrap/ConfigurableBootstrapContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>ConfigurableBootstrapContext</code></a> - A bootstrap context that can be used to\nstore objects that may be expensive to create, or need to be shared\n(<a href=\"../../bootstrap/BootstrapContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapContext</code></a> or <a href=\"../../bootstrap/BootstrapRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapRegistry</code></a> may also be used).",
